cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below. A DOI will be added at the first frozen release."
type: dataset
title: "enron-memory-replay: a personal memory core replayed through the Enron kaminski-v mailbox"
authors:
  - family-names: Akadal
    given-names: Emre
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6817-0127"
    affiliation: "Istanbul University"
abstract: >-
  An eleman memory core (an AI assistant's long-term memory kept as markdown in git) that lived
  through one real mailbox: the kaminski-v mailbox of the CMU Enron corpus, 11,523 messages,
  replayed in arrival order. Each message is kept verbatim, captured into short notes by a model,
  and distilled by a weekly unattended consolidation; every distilled fact links to its source
  message and a ledger accounts for every message.
repository-code: "https://github.com/akadal/enron-memory-replay"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - long-term memory
  - memory consolidation
  - Enron email corpus
  - large language models
  - dataset
